# This folder stores screenshots for the Raycast Store
#
# Screenshot requirements:
# - Format: PNG
# - Size: 2000x1250 pixels
# - Use Raycast's Window Capture feature to take screenshots
#
# To capture screenshots:
# 1. Open Raycast Preferences
# 2. Go to Advanced → Set Window Capture Shortcut
# 3. Run the extension command
# 4. Press your Window Capture shortcut
# 5. Save the screenshot to this folder
